{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/tuifeq","slide":2,"title":"Existing Emergency Response Challenges","textShapes":16}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/cf61sb2x","slide":2,"bbox":[0,0,1280,720]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/bex0z6ls","slide":2,"bbox":[0,0,10,720]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/adojq1k7","slide":2,"text":"Existing Emergency Response Challenges","textPreview":"Existing Emergency Response Challenges","textChars":38,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,33,1160,76]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/pcfixw3m","slide":2,"bbox":[58,118,1160,0]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ob61or21","slide":2,"text":"NearHelp AI  /  Project review","textPreview":"NearHelp AI  /  Project review","textChars":30,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,678,800,20]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/nqx0vmlg","slide":2,"text":"02","textPreview":"02","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1160,674,60,26]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2pojmhkv","slide":2,"text":"The critical gap is what a person can do before organized help arrives.","textPreview":"The critical gap is what a person can do before organized help arrives.","textChars":71,"textLines":1,"bbox":[65,149,1100,53]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/t8j290jq","slide":2,"text":"01","textPreview":"01","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[70,245,65,45]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/87q10v25","slide":2,"text":"Time and distance","textPreview":"Time and distance","textChars":17,"textLines":1,"bbox":[140,245,450,42]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/25wzu5gj","slide":2,"text":"Professional responders may be several minutes away when an incident begins.","textPreview":"Professional responders may be several minutes away when an incident begins.","textChars":76,"textLines":1,"bbox":[140,288,450,73]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/n6503ax4","slide":2,"text":"02","textPreview":"02","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[665,245,65,45]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/o7ehwfyp","slide":2,"text":"Bystander uncertainty","textPreview":"Bystander uncertainty","textChars":21,"textLines":1,"bbox":[735,245,450,42]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/p8ni5kfu","slide":2,"text":"People nearby may be willing to help but may not know a safe first step.","textPreview":"People nearby may be willing to help but may not know a safe first step.","textChars":72,"textLines":1,"bbox":[735,288,450,73]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ehczqlg7","slide":2,"text":"03","textPreview":"03","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[70,427,65,45]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/f2l0zqxs","slide":2,"text":"Location friction","textPreview":"Location friction","textChars":17,"textLines":1,"bbox":[140,427,450,42]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/03ehsvyd","slide":2,"text":"Describing an exact location during stress can slow a request for help.","textPreview":"Describing an exact location during stress can slow a request for help.","textChars":71,"textLines":1,"bbox":[140,470,450,73]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/14ni10fy","slide":2,"text":"04","textPreview":"04","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[665,427,65,45]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ydgj2pgr","slide":2,"text":"Fragmented tools","textPreview":"Fragmented tools","textChars":16,"textLines":1,"bbox":[735,427,450,42]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zyp0buxc","slide":2,"text":"Calling, maps and guidance are often separate interactions for the user.","textPreview":"Calling, maps and guidance are often separate interactions for the user.","textChars":72,"textLines":1,"bbox":[735,470,450,73]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/tuifeq","slide":2,"text":"WHO emphasizes the need for timely emergency care: https://www.who.int/health-topics/emergency-care . 112 India provides a location-enabled SOS system, so this slide does not claim location sharing is absent from existing systems: https://112.gov.in/ . The challenges frame the user experience and are not measured outcomes for NearHelp AI."}
