{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/dgbipw7a","slide":9,"bbox":[473,311,351,0]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/y1kzi1of","slide":9,"text":"India’s 112 system already combines SOS requests with location data. NearHelp studies the user-facing guidance layer.","textPreview":"India’s 112 system already combines SOS requests with location data. NearHelp studies the user-facing guidance layer.","textChars":117,"textLines":1,"bbox":[473,337,351,166]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/z2t0r6p0","slide":9,"text":"03","textPreview":"03","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[878,158,100,48]}
