{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/90zmhkfe","slide":10,"text":"Validate protocol retrieval and medical safety guardrails.","textPreview":"Validate protocol retrieval and medical safety guardrails.","textChars":58,"textLines":1,"bbox":[697,221,478,66]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/y9o3ilgr","slide":10,"text":"Connect and verify nearby responders, then add live rescue tracking.","textPreview":"Connect and verify nearby responders, then add live rescue tracking.","textChars":68,"textLines":1,"bbox":[697,315,478,76]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zax4bqxc","slide":10,"text":"Expand access with Bengali, Hindi and English support.","textPreview":"Expand access with Bengali, Hindi and English support.","textChars":54,"textLines":1,"bbox":[697,421,478,66]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/kbqlkvyx","slide":10,"bbox":[69,558,1138,84]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lczmd0f2","slide":10,"text":"Conclusion: NearHelp AI now demonstrates the mobile foundation for location-aware emergency assistance.","textPreview":"Conclusion: NearHelp AI now demonstrates the mobile foundation for location-aware emergency assistance.","textChars":103,"textLines":1,"bbox":[95,566,1080,71]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/nj3hs6","slide":10,"text":"Limitations are framed around the evidence available in repository screenshots. Future scope follows ppt_instruction.md. No claim of clinical validation or real-world rescue performance is made."}